/--
Definition of `accumulate` / `accumulate` 的定义

English:
definition accumulate
  signature: (n m : Nat)
  body: ∑ i : Fin n with j.val <= i.val, t i
map_zero' := funext fun _ => sum_eq_zero fun _ _ => rfl
map_add' _ _ := funext fun _ => sum_add_distrib

中文:
定义 accumulate
  签名: (n m : 自然数)
